{"strongs": "H3809", "word": "אם לא", "translit": "la", "root": "אםלא", "morph": "A:Neg", "pos": "conjunction", "gloss": "except, but", "definition": "II. לָהֵן conjunction except, but (from לָא and הֵן 'not if' (compare Hebrew אם לא Gen 24:38 ); so Nabataean and Egyptian Aramaic להן Cooke 217, 219, 241 S-C Pap. C 6, 7 +; lâinnî, however Soc Arab. Dial. see Marokko 44, Anm. 103; ᵑ7 אִילָּהֵין Gen 32:28 ; Gen 43:3 and elsewhere); — 1. after a negative (= Biblical Hebrew כִּי אִם , q. v.): \\ \\ a. except Dan 2:11 ; Dan 3:28 ; Dan 6:6 ; Dan 6:8 . \\ \\ b. but (German sondern ) Dan 2:30 . 2. without a negative: however, but Ezra 5:12 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9640')\">BDB9640</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3809')\">H3809</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3861')\">H3861</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H518')\">H518</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H2006')\">H2006</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3808')\">H3808</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3588')\">H3588</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9639')\">BDB9639</entry> | BIBLICAL ARAMAIC | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9641')\">BDB9641</entry></div><p> II. <bdbarc>לָהֵן</bdbarc> <b>conjunction</b> <highlightword>except, but</highlightword> (from <bdbarc>לָא</bdbarc> and <bdbarc>הֵן</bdbarc> 'not if' (compare Hebrew <bdbheb>אם לא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 24:38\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(1,24,38)\">Gen 24:38</ref>); so Nabataean and Egyptian Aramaic <bdbarc>להן</bdbarc> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Cooke')\">Cooke<sup>217, 219, 241</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('S-C')\">S-C<sup>Pap. C 6, 7</sup></lookup> +; <highlight>lâinnî, however</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('So')\">Soc<sup>Arab. Dial.</sup></lookup> see Marokko 44, Anm. 103; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbarc>אִילָּהֵין</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Gen 32:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"28\" oncli